fn gui_rgba8888_compositor_tile_rle_encode_cursor_owner_new %fn GuiRgba8888RowTileRleEncodeCursorOwner fn GuiRgba8888CompositorFrameEntryMetadata GuiRgba8888CompositorTileRleEncodeCursorOwner \ready\metadata:
    GuiRgba8888CompositorTileRleEncodeCursorOwner ready metadata

//: gui_rgba8888_compositor_tile_rle_encode_cursor_error_new: cursor error payload を[作/つく]る
//:
//: lower kind、category、total、start kind、回収用 payload owner を 1 つの owner-bearing error にまとめます。
//:
//: neplg2:test[skip]
//: ```neplg2
//:| #import "alloc/gui/render2d/compositor_tile_rle_encode_cursor" as *
